      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A N2-bridged diiron complex [Cp*(Ph2PC6H4S)Fe]2(μ-N2) (1) has been found to catalyze the hydroboration of N-heteroarenes with pinacolborane, giving N-borylated 1,2-reduced products with high regioselectivity. The catalysis is initiated by coordination of N-heteroarenes to the iron center, while the B-H bond cleavage is the rate-determining step."},
